    kind: invariant  # c1ea
    title: "A module the classifier matched a call into is reported method-starved in the same run: JS process on 6/9 JS-bearing repos (since WI-kikar gave process member calls a slot) and python ctypes.cdll -- the INV-fugus contradiction, fourth occurrence"  # c1ea
    status: violated  # c1ea
    priority: 2  # c1ea
    parent:  # c1ea
    tags:  # c1ea
    - io_boundary  # c1ea
    - verify_claims  # c1ea
